{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang HK\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Noto Sans\", \"Noto Sans CJK\", sans-serif'>新皇崗口岸大樓下周一上午6時半正式開通，星期日上午會舉行開通儀式。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: SourceHanSansCNRegular\">➤　</span><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199881-%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%87%E5%B4%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E4%B8%8B%E5%91%A8%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%8A%E5%8D%886%E6%99%82%E5%8D%8A%E6%AD%A3%E5%BC%8F%E9%96%8B%E9%80%9A%E9%84%A7%E7%82%B3%E5%BC%B7%E8%9E%8D%E5%85%A5%E5%9C%8B%E5%AE%B6%E7%99%BC%E5%B1%95%E5%A4%A7%E5%B1%80%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81%E9%87%8C%E7%A8%8B%E7%A2%91\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>新皇崗口岸下周一上午6時半正式開通　鄧炳強：融入國家發展大局重要里程碑</strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang HK\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Noto Sans\", \"Noto Sans CJK\", sans-serif'>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案續審，案件早上10時開庭。法官表示，有事項需要同控辯律師團處理。陪審團可先行離開，下周一繼續審訊。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: SourceHanSansCNRegular\">➤　</span><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199848-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%8B%E9%A0%85%E9%9C%80%E5%90%8C%E6%8E%A7%E8%BE%AF%E5%BE%8B%E5%B8%AB%E5%9C%98%E8%99%95%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8B%E5%91%A8%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%8C%E5%AF%A9\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>蔡天鳳碎屍案｜法官：有事項需同控辯律師團處理　下周一續審</strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang HK\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Noto Sans\", \"Noto Sans CJK\", sans-serif'>警方國安處起訴一名男子，涉嫌發布具煽動意圖的刊物。國安處周三正式落案起訴他，《維護國家安全條例》下的「明知而發布具煽動意圖的刊物」罪。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: SourceHanSansCNRegular\">➤　</span><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199843-%E5%9C%8B%E5%AE%89%E8%99%95%E8%B5%B7%E8%A8%B4%E4%B8%80%E7%94%B7%E6%B6%89%E7%99%BC%E5%B8%83%E5%85%B7%E7%85%BD%E5%8B%95%E6%84%8F%E5%9C%96%E5%88%8A%E7%89%A9\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>國安處起訴一男　涉發布具煽動意圖刊物</strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang HK\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Noto Sans\", \"Noto Sans CJK\", sans-serif'>廉署起訴上市公司綠城中國前主席張亞東涉嫌收賄2,000萬港元，以促成大連房產收購項目。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: SourceHanSansCNRegular\">➤　</span><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199858-%E7%B6%A0%E5%9F%8E%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%8B%E5%89%8D%E4%B8%BB%E5%B8%AD%E5%BC%B5%E4%BA%9E%E6%9D%B1%E6%B6%89%E6%94%B6%E8%B3%842%E5%8D%83%E8%90%AC%E4%BF%83%E6%88%90%E5%A4%A7%E9%80%A3%E6%88%BF%E7%94%A2%E6%94%B6%E8%B3%BC%E8%A2%AB%E6%8E%A7%E4%B8%B2%E8%AC%80%E4%BD%BF%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E4%BA%BA%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E7%BD%AA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>綠城中國前主席張亞東涉收賄2千萬促成大連房產收購　被控串謀使代理人接受利益罪</strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-09T09:58:42.616846+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":347,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}